{"id":"633530","name":"黄瓜拌拉皮","author":"冬季心情","authorId":"8473848","desc":"","cover":"images/633530/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"50g"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"35g"},{"name":"拉皮","amount":"1袋"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"3瓣"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1g"},{"name":"香油","amount":"2g"},{"name":"六月鲜特级原汁酱油","amount":"10g"},{"name":"味达美清香米醋","amount":"10g"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"2g"},{"name":"辣椒红油","amount":"3g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"原料：黄瓜，洋葱，拉皮，蒜，六月鲜特级原汁酱油，味达美清香米醋。","img":"images/633530/step_1.jpeg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黄瓜和洋葱切丝，拉皮清洗干净放入盆中。","img":"images/633530/step_2.jpeg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜切碎倒入碗中。","img":"images/633530/step_3.jpeg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入六月鲜特级原汁酱油。","img":"images/633530/step_4.jpeg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加味达美清香米醋。","img":"images/633530/step_5.jpeg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入盐。","img":"images/633530/step_6.jpeg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入白糖。","img":"images/633530/step_7.jpeg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加香油提香。","img":"images/633530/step_8.jpeg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将调料汁倒入盆中，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/633530/step_9.jpeg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入辣椒红油，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/633530/step_10.jpeg"},{"step":11,"desc":"黄瓜拌拉皮做好啦。","img":"images/633530/step_11.jpeg"}],"tips":"根据自己的口味，加入适量的辣椒红油。拉皮，我是买的袋装的。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}